    "title": "treeview.md",
    "text": "**Removing a thread subtree leaks its descendants' tombstones into the tracked mirror**: this contradicts [Threads persist to `.state/` by membership, not by class](../design/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3WYRG8001), which says pruning a thread is an ordinary `remove`. Found 2026-09-27 when resetting both threads.",
