        "value": "Fully implemented and migrated: all three cases of the unified list law are live, and the real corpus has zero bare `list` nodes left."
      }
    ],
    "title": "list-consumption.md",
    "text": "Fully implemented and migrated. All three cases of the unified law (consumption, dissolution via merged self, dissolution when orphaned) are live in `astParser.ts`/`project.ts`, `orderedList`/`startIndex` are normalized onto each run's own first item everywhere, and the real corpus (48 legacy anchors relocated, 59 live `list` nodes fixpoint-spliced and tombstoned) has been migrated — zero `list`-typed BlockNodes remain live. See [Issues](../issues/list-consumption.md) (now all resolved) and [Planning](../planning/list-consumption.md) (Task Breakdown, all done).",
    "parent": "FolderNode:00CDBYV4BR002",
